    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated in the heart of Liscarroll village, this mid-terrace derelict property extends to approximately 900 sq. ft. and presents a fantastic opportunity for those seeking a full renovation project.\n\nWhile the property requires complete refurbishment throughout, it offers huge potential to create a charming home or investment property. The dwelling may also qualify for the Vacant/Derelict Property Refurbishment Grant (subject to eligibility and approval).\n\nA standout feature is the large rear garden, providing excellent scope for extension, landscaping or outdoor living space.\n\nConveniently located within walking distance of local amenities, including schools, shops, pubs and village services, the property benefits from a strong community setting.\n\nLiscarroll is ideally positioned just 10 km from Buttevant and approximately 17 km from both Mallow and Charleville, offering easy access to larger towns and transport links.\n\nThis is a superb investment opportunity for builders, investors, or owner-occupiers looking to put their own stamp on a property."
      },
